# Frontend Rules

- Use TypeScript only
- Use functional components
- Use TailwindCSS
- Use feature-based structure
- Use reusable hooks
- Use React Query for server state
- Import domain types from `@my-bahrain/types`
- Validate forms with schemas from `@my-bahrain/validators`
- Use React Hook Form + Zod resolver

# Forbidden

- No inline business logic
- No giant components
- No hardcoded API URLs
- No duplicated UI
- No business constants (fees, statuses, limits) — use Convex settings
